WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.424
After founding the Mongol regime, Genghis Khan turned his gaze to the west.

00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:08.582
He listened carefully to his generals' reports.

00:00:08.932 --> 00:00:14.572
The great Mongol army set out for Central Asia in mighty array.

00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:22.194
War horses neighed and dust flew; the great army stretched as far as the eye could see.

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:26.360
City after city was brought into the Mongol realm.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:31.102
The city gates slowly opened to a new era.

00:00:31.452 --> 00:00:35.916
Wherever the horses' hooves reached, East and West began to exchange.

00:00:36.266 --> 00:00:39.170
Camel caravans brought goods from far away.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.432
On the Silk Road, caravans once again came and went.

00:00:43.782 --> 00:00:47.430
Silk and spices once again flowed to many places.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.332
The western campaigns changed the history of the whole Eurasian continent.

00:00:51.682 --> 00:00:55.066
The glow of the setting sun spread over the vast land.

